<title>UK: BAe H1 pretax profit leaps 75 percent.</title>
<headline>BAe H1 pretax profit leaps 75 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		31.2		   vs 12.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.25		   vs 5.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     199		    vs 114</p>
<p> Turnover		   2.918 billion	vs 2.859 billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts expected pre-tax profits in a range of 185 to 220 million stg compared with a year ago when the company reported 160 million stg before and 118 million stg after exceptional charges.</p>
</text>
